  83+ 6D1E              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
  84+ 6D1E              ; Public timestamp API.
  85+ 6D1E              ; Output txt_hour/txt_min/txt_sec = two decimal ASCII digits.
  86+ 6D1E              ; If DS12887 is unavailable or UIP never clears, outputs "??".
  87+ 6D1E              ; AF/BC/DE/HL are preserved for the caller.
  88+ 6D1E              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
  89+ 6D1E              READ_CURRENT_TIME:
  89+ 6D1E
