 699+ 7F03              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
 700+ 7F03              ; Reverse-DMA transport self-test.
 701+ 7F03              ; The host reads a 00..FF pattern from the NeoGS DMA window into #C000.
 702+ 7F03              ; The payload itself never uses GSDAT/DBIT; GSCOM is only the command/doorbell.
 703+ 7F03              ; OUT: carry clear on a byte-perfect 256-byte transfer.
 704+ 7F03              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
 705+ 7F03              p125_dma_reverse_selftest:
