  18+ 7F63              ; Entry: neogs_bios_load_from_trdos
  19+ 7F63              ; OUT: carry clear after NeoGS acknowledges the complete 8 KiB transfer.
  20+ 7F63              ;     A=0 on success; A=error code on failure.
  21+ 7F63              ; The routine leaves interrupts disabled; caller owns final EI/DI policy.
  22+ 7F63              ; =========================================================================
  23+ 7F63
